// Local teaching conversion draft; NOT a foundry-qualified or equivalent deck.
// Source: local CORNERSTONE v3.1 KLayout pre-DRC, 2025-03-03.
// Coverage: 16 basic width/spacing checks. See coverage.json for exclusions.
// Acute-corner, zero-area marker and Euclidean semantics require validation.
PRECISION 1000
RESOLUTION 1
DRC MAXIMUM RESULTS ALL
LAYER MAP 60 DATATYPE 0 60
LAYER CS60 60
LAYER MAP 6 DATATYPE 0 6
LAYER CS6 6
LAYER MAP 3 DATATYPE 0 3
LAYER CS3 3
LAYER MAP 4 DATATYPE 0 4
